{"articleNo":"490241","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=490241&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] [메이커빌리지] 6월 메이커 교육 참가자 모집!(재학생 및 금오공대 직원 참여 가능.)","writer":"기술창업지원실","writeDate":"2024.06.17","hit":"4304","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">메이커스페이스 6월 교육 참가자를 모집합니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">국립금오공과대학교 재직자 및 학생들, 그리고 일반인까지 모두 참석 가능합니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">즐거운 메이커 시간을 보내며 추억을 남겨보시길 바래요.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">참가 신청 :&nbsp;<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSclWBd4X8dajl_nNBQDReEZWtiTYzkkWE9qVhzPeBPtWuqnVQ/viewform?usp=sf_linkhttps://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSclWBd4X8dajl_nNBQDReEZWtiTYzkkWE9qVhzPeBPtWuqnVQ/viewform?usp=sf_link\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSclWBd4X8dajl_nNBQDReEZWtiTYzkkWE9qVhzPeBPtWuqnVQ/viewform?usp=sf_link</a></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmBYHoQNkgnAagDQC4FcCKBxAkgQQBMBZAI3wEcBRAdQE8AtUgGQDoApABWyA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmBYHoQNkgtAdgGQF4FUCKA5A5gTQFkAHAU2QCtkAFAG1ICMGA6AKWoHEg%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmBYHoQNkhhAhgLwKYHV0BEASz0CKAJgHICCASgLIDGAGjgPIB0AUgAoDiQA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editor